{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Supporter Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The suspenseful visual novel game\u00a0Threads of Karma, developed solo by <i>\u841d\u535c\u4e0d\u957f\u6bdb</i>, is now officially released\u2014thank you for your support! If you love the game, you can purchase this Supporter Pack to show your appreciation for the developers. We've also prepared some virtual gifts for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Contents</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Threads of Karma</i> Theme Music from \u89e3\u8bed\u82b1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">48 hand-drawn game illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 full-character portraits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A heartfelt thank-you from the developers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note that this DLC is meant to show your support for the solo Dev \u841d\u535c\u4e0d\u957f\u6bdb, and the above content is just a small token of our gratitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Q: Where can I find the contents of the Supporter Pack?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A:</strong> After purchasing, go to your Steam Library, select <i>Repayment</i>, right-click \u2192 Manage \u2192 Browse Local Files. The contents of the Supporter Pack can be found in the <strong>Support Pack</strong> folder.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595950?t=1743663406","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595950?t=1743663406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595950/d850a55779c0cbc6e4cead049a742a6b0e38a085/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743663406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595950/d850a55779c0cbc6e4cead049a742a6b0e38a085/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743663406","catego